    "Business analyst with a background in retail and logistics. Skilled at finding the cause behind a trend and presenting it in plain language to non-technical colleagues.": {
      "comment": "Writing examples library (resume example text the person can insert). Fictional, generic.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Business Analyst mit Hintergrund in Einzelhandel und Logistik. Findet die Ursache hinter einem Trend und erklärt sie auch fachfremden Kolleginnen und Kollegen in verständlicher Sprache."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Analista de negocio con experiencia en comercio minorista y logística. Capacidad para encontrar la causa de una tendencia y explicarla con un lenguaje sencillo a compañeros sin perfil técnico."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
