    "CareerKit has no subscription and no paywall. This is the full picture of where ads appear and why.": {
      "comment": "Profile > How exports work",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "CareerKit hat kein Abo und keine Bezahlschranke. Hier sehen Sie vollständig, wo Werbung erscheint und warum."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "CareerKit no tiene suscripción ni muro de pago. Aquí tienes toda la información sobre dónde aparecen los anuncios y por qué."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "CareerKit n’a ni abonnement ni accès payant. Voici, en toute transparence, où les publicités apparaissent et pourquoi."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "CareerKit 没有订阅，也没有付费墙。以下完整说明了广告出现的位置和原因。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "CareerKit imports PDFs up to 10 MB. Export a smaller copy, or paste the text instead.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "CareerKit importiert PDFs bis 10 MB. Exportieren Sie eine kleinere Kopie oder fügen Sie stattdessen den Text ein."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "CareerKit importa PDF de hasta 10 MB. Exporta una copia más pequeña o pega el texto."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "CareerKit importe les PDF jusqu'à 10 Mo. Exportez une copie plus légère ou collez plutôt le texte."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "CareerKit 可导入最大 10 MB 的 PDF。请导出一个更小的副本，或直接粘贴文字。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "CareerKit is free to use. Saving, sharing or printing a finished document uses one export, which you can buy or earn by watching a short video.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "CareerKit ist kostenlos nutzbar. Ein fertiges Dokument zu speichern, zu teilen oder zu drucken verbraucht einen Export, den du kaufen oder durch ein kurzes Video erhalten kannst."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "CareerKit es gratis. Guardar, compartir o imprimir un documento terminado usa una exportación, que puedes comprar u obtener viendo un vídeo corto."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "CareerKit est gratuit. Enregistrer, partager ou imprimer un document terminé utilise un export, que vous pouvez acheter ou obtenir en regardant une courte vidéo."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "CareerKit 可免费使用。保存、共享或打印完成的文档会用掉一次导出，你可以购买，也可以观看短视频获得。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "CareerKit is free to use. This is the full picture of what is free, what uses an export, and where ads appear.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "CareerKit ist kostenlos nutzbar. Hier steht alles: was kostenlos ist, was einen Export verbraucht und wo Werbung erscheint."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "CareerKit es gratis. Aquí tienes todo claro: qué es gratis, qué usa una exportación y dónde aparecen los anuncios."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "CareerKit est gratuit. Voici le tableau complet : ce qui est gratuit, ce qui utilise un export et où apparaissent les publicités."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "CareerKit 可免费使用。下面完整说明哪些功能免费、哪些会用掉一次导出，以及广告出现的位置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "CareerKit is free. Exporting a finished document needs one short rewarded video. Everything else has no ad wall.": {
