    "Finance professional with eight years of experience in budgeting, forecasting and month-end reporting. Known for turning complex numbers into clear recommendations that leadership can act on.": {
      "comment": "Writing examples library (resume example text the person can insert). Fictional, generic.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Finanzfachkraft mit acht Jahren Erfahrung in Budgetierung, Forecasting und Monatsabschluss-Reporting. Bekannt dafür, komplexe Zahlen in klare, umsetzbare Empfehlungen für die Geschäftsleitung zu übersetzen."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Profesional de finanzas con ocho años de experiencia en presupuestos, previsiones y cierres mensuales. Destaca por convertir cifras complejas en recomendaciones claras que la dirección puede aplicar."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Huit ans d’expérience en finance : budgets, prévisions et reporting de clôture mensuelle. Capacité reconnue à transformer des chiffres complexes en recommandations claires, directement exploitables par la direction."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "拥有八年预算编制、财务预测和月结报告经验的财务专业人士。善于将复杂数据转化为清晰、可供管理层直接采纳的建议。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
