    "Former hospitality manager moving into customer success. Eight years of handling complaints, training teams and keeping regular customers happy carry over directly to this work.": {
      "comment": "Writing examples library (resume example text the person can insert). Fictional, generic.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ehemaliger Restaurantleiter auf dem Weg ins Customer Success. Acht Jahre Erfahrung mit Beschwerdemanagement, Teamschulungen und Stammkundenpflege lassen sich direkt auf diese Aufgabe übertragen."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Antiguo responsable de hostelería que da el paso a customer success. Ocho años gestionando reclamaciones, formando equipos y fidelizando a clientes habituales se trasladan directamente a este trabajo."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ancien responsable en hôtellerie-restauration en reconversion vers le customer success. Huit ans de gestion des réclamations, de formation d’équipes et de fidélisation de la clientèle, des compétences directement transposables à ce poste."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "原餐饮管理人员，正转型从事客户成功工作。八年处理投诉、培训团队和维护老客户的经验可直接用于这一岗位。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
