    "I am applying for the {role} position because it combines the skills I have built over my career with work I find worthwhile.": {
      "comment": "Cover letter suggestion. Letter content: formal register. Placeholders {company} {manager} {position} are replaced by the app; translations use {position} (a full noun phrase) instead of {role}.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ich bewerbe mich auf {position}, weil sie die Fähigkeiten, die ich im Laufe meiner Karriere aufgebaut habe, mit einer Arbeit verbindet, die ich für sinnvoll halte."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Presento mi candidatura para {position} porque combina las habilidades que he desarrollado a lo largo de mi carrera con un trabajo que considero valioso."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je postule pour {position} car il associe les compétences acquises au cours de ma carrière à un travail qui a du sens pour moi."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "我申请{position}，是因为它将我多年积累的技能与我认为有意义的工作结合在一起。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "I am drawn to {company} because of the way it serves its customers, and I would like to be part of that work.": {
      "comment": "Cover letter suggestion. Letter content: formal register. Placeholders {company} {manager} {position} are replaced by the app; translations use {position} (a full noun phrase) instead of {role}.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "An {company} schätze ich die Art, wie Kundinnen und Kunden betreut werden, und ich möchte Teil dieser Arbeit sein."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Me atrae {company} por la forma en que atiende a sus clientes, y me gustaría formar parte de ese trabajo."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La manière dont {company} sert ses clients me parle, et j’aimerais contribuer à ce travail."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "我很欣赏{company}服务客户的方式，希望能参与其中。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "I am writing to apply for the {role} position at {company}. My background in the field has prepared me well for this work, and I would like to contribute to your team.": {
      "comment": "Cover letter suggestion. Letter content: formal register. Placeholders {company} {manager} {position} are replaced by the app; translations use {position} (a full noun phrase) instead of {role}.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hiermit bewerbe ich mich für {position} bei {company}. Meine Erfahrung in diesem Bereich hat mich gut auf diese Aufgabe vorbereitet, und ich möchte gern zu Ihrem Team beitragen."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le escribo para presentar mi candidatura para {position} en {company}. Mi trayectoria en el sector me ha preparado bien para este trabajo y me gustaría aportar a su equipo."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je vous adresse ma candidature pour {position} au sein de {company}. Mon parcours dans ce domaine constitue une bonne préparation à ce travail et je souhaite contribuer à votre équipe."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "我写信申请{company}的{position}。我在该领域的经验让我为这份工作做好了充分准备，希望能为贵团队贡献力量。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
