    "My experience includes planning work, communicating with customers and colleagues, and learning new tools quickly. I am comfortable working independently and as part of a team.": {
      "comment": "Cover letter suggestion. Letter content: formal register. Placeholders {company} {manager} {position} are replaced by the app; translations use {position} (a full noun phrase) instead of {role}.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Zu meiner Erfahrung gehören die Arbeitsplanung, die Kommunikation mit Kunden und Kollegen sowie die schnelle Einarbeitung in neue Tools. Ich arbeite gern selbstständig und im Team."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mi experiencia incluye planificar el trabajo, comunicarme con clientes y compañeros y aprender nuevas herramientas con rapidez. Trabajo con soltura tanto de forma autónoma como en equipo."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
