    "Operations manager who has led teams of up to 25 people across two sites. Focused on steady process improvement, accurate reporting and a calm, reliable working style.": {
      "comment": "Writing examples library (resume example text the person can insert). Fictional, generic.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Operations Manager mit Führungserfahrung für Teams von bis zu 25 Personen an zwei Standorten. Schwerpunkte: kontinuierliche Prozessverbesserung, genaues Reporting und ein ruhiger, verlässlicher Arbeitsstil."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Responsable de operaciones que ha dirigido equipos de hasta 25 personas en dos centros. Centrado en la mejora continua de procesos, informes precisos y un estilo de trabajo tranquilo y fiable."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Responsable des opérations ayant encadré jusqu’à 25 personnes sur deux sites. Approche centrée sur l’amélioration continue des processus, un reporting précis et un style de travail calme et fiable."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "运营经理，曾在两个工作地点带领最多 25 人的团队。注重持续改进流程、准确汇报，工作风格沉稳可靠。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
