    "Taught classes of 28 pupils and raised the share meeting reading targets from 70 to 85 percent.": {
      "comment": "Writing examples library (resume example text the person can insert). Fictional, generic.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Unterricht in Klassen mit 28 Schülerinnen und Schülern; Steigerung des Anteils, der die Leseziele erreichte, von 70 auf 85 Prozent."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Impartí clase a grupos de 28 alumnos y aumenté del 70 al 85 por ciento la proporción que alcanzaba los objetivos de lectura."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Enseigné à des classes de 28 élèves et fait passer de 70 à 85 pour cent la part atteignant les objectifs de lecture."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "负责 28 人班级的教学，使达到阅读目标的学生比例从 70％ 提高到 85％。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Teacher moving into learning and development. Experienced in planning, presenting and giving feedback, and recently completed a certificate in instructional design.": {
      "comment": "Writing examples library (resume example text the person can insert). Fictional, generic.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
