            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce texte est trop long pour l’aide à la rédaction. Essayez sur un passage plus court."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这段文字太长，写作助手无法处理。请试试较短的部分。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This text was very long, so only the first 100,000 characters were read.": {
